row('PV-CALC-14', P, 'Settled by seeding: no core-flagged part existed, so a catalogue + inventory part ZZAUTOTEST-CORE-1 was created (5 on hand) - it correctly APPEARED - and then a $25 core was attached, which created a separate linked core-part record. That core record appears in NEITHER the inventory list NOR Parts Velocity, while its parent (which merely carries a core charge) does. All seeded data was deleted afterwards.', E_CORE, RC_STD)
